      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ONE MORE BUTTON (4) was below best last time when fourth but prior to that was a Grade 5 winner in quick time at Ballarat. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. GALBA STACEY (7) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 4.5 lengths at Mt Gambier in a handy 17.34 beating Gus Limes. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Expected to feature again. CRACKERJACK KEV (1) has been hard to follow lately, running seventh (19.90) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at Horsham. Can hit the frame this time. NOT SORRY (2) showed great speed to lead all the way last start. Big chance again.",
